        "lessons.w12.focused3.easy": "Runny magma lets the gas bubble out easily, so the lava just flows out, like on the volcanoes of Hawaii.",
        "lessons.w12.focused3.like": "That's like opening a bottle that hasn't been shaken: the gas escapes calmly."
